ADDITIONAL NOTICE - EXPERIMENTAL SOFTWARE

This project is an EXPERIMENTAL proof-of-concept for security research and
education. It detects an infrared flash *pattern* that is *consistent with*
some ALPR / surveillance cameras; it does NOT positively identify any specific
product, brand, or device, and it can be triggered by unrelated infrared
sources. A positive indication is NOT proof that any camera is present. Always
visually confirm. Use only where lawful and only on infrastructure/spectrum you
are authorized to observe. The authors accept no liability for any use.
